00:17:45,410 --> 00:17:48,370
for life ?

281
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:54,130
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

282
00:17:51,890 --> 00:17:54,130
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

283
00:17:54,450 --> 00:17:57,530
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

284
00:17:57,890 --> 00:18:03,530
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

285
00:18:00,610 --> 00:18:03,530
out of reach.

286
00:18:04,890 --> 00:18:09,010
Immortals

287
00:18:05,930 --> 00:18:09,010
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

288
00:18:09,290 --> 00:18:13,050
Renegades

289
00:18:10,050 --> 00:18:13,050
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

290
00:18:13,050 --> 00:18:16,890
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

291
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:16,890
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

292
00:18:17,130 --> 00:18:21,010
because I don't see the harm in that.

293
00:18:23,010 --> 00:18:28,810
My new body opens its eyes

294
00:18:25,530 --> 00:18:28,810
and awakens from its dream.

295
00:18:28,930 --> 00:18:36,370
I have overcome many trials

296
00:18:31,050 --> 00:18:36,370
to get this body back.

297
00:18:36,570 --> 00:18:44,010
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

298
00:18:40,610 --> 00:18:44,010
I can still see.

299
00:18:44,410 --> 00:18:53,370
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

300
00:18:48,370 --> 00:18:53,370
by my own hands.

301
00:19:08,810 --> 00:19:14,770
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

302
00:19:11,530 --> 00:19:14,770
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

303
00:19:14,770 --> 00:19:22,330
With a flick of a finger,

304
00:19:16,210 --> 00:19:22,330
only my indomitable heart remains.

305
00:19:22,370 --> 00:19:31,730
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

306
00:19:28,330 --> 00:19:31,730
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

307
00:19:31,970 --> 00:19:39,570
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

308
00:19:34,490 --> 00:19:39,570
like the descent of a god.
